*** Add File:ops/docs/legal_and_compliance/checklist_autonomy.md
+# Legal & Compliance Checklist for Autonomous Actions
+
+Before enabling auto-remediation/retrain/promotion, ensure:
+
+1) Policy review
+ - OPA policies have been reviewed and signed-off by Legal & Compliance.
+ - Human-required actions are explicitly enumerated and cannot be bypassed by policy.
+
+2) Auditability
+ - All automated actions write immutable evidence to audit storage (S3).
+ - Evidence bundles are cosign-signed and Rekor entries are created.
+ - Approver decisions (if any) are recorded with identity and timestamp.
+
+3) Data protection
+ - DP accounting is enabled and enforced; fail-closed must be configured for production.
+ - Data retention and deletion policies are defined and implemented for evidence and training data.
+
+4) Incident response
+ - Runbooks for containment, escalation and legal notification exist and have been exercised.
+ - SLAs for notifications (internal / regulatory) are defined.
+
+5) Approval & scope
+ - Define what model families, environments, and users are in-scope for automation.
+ - High-impact models (finance/health/legal) require manual sign-off for promotion.
+
+6) External audit
+ - Plan for external audit of automation and evidence chain prior to production autonomy.
+
