*** Add File:ops/human_review/approvals_matrix.md
+# Approval Matrix — actions vs required approvers
+
+Low-risk actions (auto allowed)
+- Auto-block outputs, update blacklist: automated (no human required); audit only.
+
+Medium-risk actions (1 approver required)
+- Retrain trigger & canary promotion for staging models: 1 approver from ML Ops.
+
+High-risk actions (multi-party required)
+- Promote model to production: 2 approvers (ML Lead + Security Lead) OR automated if passing 14-day canary window + safety/regression tests AND explicit policy flag.
+- Purge dataset / delete backups: Legal + Data Owner sign-off (2 approvals).
+
+Emergency actions
+- Emergency disable model: automated allowed for incidents with score >= 0.995 OR manual on-call override; always require post‑hoc incident review.
+
